Product Analytics Data Platform — Data Engineering Project

Designed and built an end-to-end ELT data platform ingesting raw event and transaction data into an analytics-ready warehouse

Implemented batch pipelines using Python, SQL, dbt, and Airflow with retries, idempotency, and backfill support

Modeled analytics data using a star schema with fact and dimension tables to support product and revenue metrics

Built incremental transformations and partitioned tables to reduce warehouse compute cost and improve query performance

Enforced data quality guarantees with automated tests for freshness, uniqueness, nulls, and referential integrity

Designed pipelines to handle late-arriving data, schema changes, and duplicate events

Documented architecture decisions, tradeoffs, and failure scenarios to support long-term maintainability